  "description": "The text overlay accuses South Africans of being complicit in or tolerant of theft by outsiders, using a dehumanizing and economically reductive stereotype. This statement relies on the implicit knowledge that South Africans are a distinct racial and national group, and that the meme's author is making a racially charged accusation against them. The statement also implies a false assumption about the attitudes of the majority of South Africans toward economic injustice and theft.",
